' From Grogono's article (BYTE, July 1979, p. 206), with spacing and these
' comments added; its printed output is grogono-parameters.out. Missing parameters are empty, extra ones are
' ignored, and a call to an undefined macro (U) does nothing.
#T; #T,"A"; #T,"A","B"; #T,"A","B","C"; #U;

$T "<" %A %B ">!" @
$$
